# iDECP Orchestrator

# ── Secrets ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

# ── Database state ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# SQLite runtime files — regenerated from source; never commit DB state.
data/*.db
data/*.sqlite
data/*.db-journal
data/*.db-wal
data/*.db-shm
data/exports/

# ── Dependencies & build artifacts ───────────────────────────────────────────
node_modules/
dist/
build/
npm-debug.log*

# ── OS & IDE ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.DS_Store
.DS_Store?
._*
.Spotlight-V100
.Trashes
ehthumbs.db
Thumbs.db
.vscode/

# ── Internal tooling ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.claude/heal-logs/
.claude/heal-failures/

# ── Discovery pipeline fixtures ───────────────────────────────────────────────
# Large fixture corpus can be regenerated; commit .gitkeep placeholders only.
# Uncomment to ignore when corpus grows beyond ~10 MB:
# data/fixtures/pages/*.json
# data/fixtures/tweets/*.json
!data/fixtures/**/.gitkeep
